[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9902.87, "timestamp": "02:45:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9904.71, "timestamp": "02:45:04", "text": "我在听。继续。是的。现在我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9907.67, "timestamp": "02:45:07", "text": "现在别担心，我可以轻松应对。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9909.99, "timestamp": "02:45:09", "text": "现在。呃，如果人们想要重新安排时间或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9912.95, "timestamp": "02:45:12", "text": "如果需要更多时间，我可以再给一次。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9917.99, "timestamp": "02:45:17", "text": "现在我有了喘息的空间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9920.309, "timestamp": "02:45:20", "text": "是的。是的。好像这是件好事似的，老兄。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9923.349, "timestamp": "02:45:23", "text": "现在至少像以前那样了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9925.03, "timestamp": "02:45:25", "text": "在你拥有喜欢之前，你必须先喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9926.71, "timestamp": "02:45:26", "text": "像东西一样拉出来。你必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9928.309, "timestamp": "02:45:28", "text": "就像切中要害一样。你必须做出"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9930.15, "timestamp": "02:45:30", "text": "一些网上的东西。你必须在线"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9932.389, "timestamp": "02:45:32", "text": "每次行动都要迅速。现在轮到你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9934.55, "timestamp": "02:45:34", "text": "慢慢来，好好享受吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9936.55, "timestamp": "02:45:36", "text": "就像和每个人聊天一样，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9938.309, "timestamp": "02:45:38", "text": "和大家一起享受，和大家一起玩耍"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9941.67, "timestamp": "02:45:41", "text": "你知道。是的。或者你可以像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9945.75, "timestamp": "02:45:45", "text": "是的。是的。呃，我当时在想，呃，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9948.87, "timestamp": "02:45:48", "text": "因为我已经安排好这些人了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9951.91, "timestamp": "02:45:51", "text": "优惠截止到21号，我想我就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9955.349, "timestamp": "02:45:55", "text": "完成它。嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9957.51, "timestamp": "02:45:57", "text": "是的，总有办法的，我总是可以"}]